WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.840
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a short Drama film called “The Boy with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:19.440
Camera for a Face”. Watch out and take care!
At the beginning of the movie, we are shown a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:26.080
broken TV. The camera zooms into it and leads us&nbsp;
to the day the protagonist is born. The doctors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:30.960
and nurses surround his mother, urging her to&nbsp;
push harder while the father sits at the other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:36.560
side with a camera. He believes that he is going&nbsp;
to capture a beautiful moment, but what happens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:42.480
next makes him put the camera away in confusion.&nbsp;
Even the nurses and the doctor share the same look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:48.080
of confusion as they pass the newborn baby around.&nbsp;
When the mother gets to hold her baby, she doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:54.080
know what to think of it because the newborn has&nbsp;
a camera for a face. He involuntarily records&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:59.520
the birth from the other side as a normal camera&nbsp;
would. The doctors go crazy trying to figure out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:04.880
how this is possible. They stare at the sonogram&nbsp;
for hours but do not seem to find the reason for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:10.960
the baby not having a face. They try to pass it up&nbsp;
as genetics but no camera genes are found in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:17.280
parents. With time, they get frustrated and start&nbsp;
blaming the mother for sleeping with a camera. 
&nbsp;

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:26.960
The husband accuses his wife of cheating. She is&nbsp;
left alone with her child and doesn’t know if she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:32.240
can ever love him as a human if he becomes the&nbsp;
reason for their divorce. But her worries fade&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:37.680
away when the doctors claim he is in fact the&nbsp;
husband's kid. They also admit that they do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:43.120
know the cause behind his head being a camera. But&nbsp;
they have found out that to keep the child alive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:47.680
they should put a blank tape in the slot&nbsp;
on his back. It must be done every night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:53.120
without fail to prevent heart failure. The blank&nbsp;
tapes mean that the kid is bound to record every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:59.600
moment of his life even if he doesn’t want to.&nbsp;
The doctor inserts the Day one’s tape on his back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.960
and sends the camera boy home with his parents.&nbsp;
By now, the parents have accepted him as he is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:10.320
because no matter the face, he will always be&nbsp;
their child. As the camera boy grows older,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:15.120
he starts to take pictures on command. One&nbsp;
day, when trying to take a family photo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:20.080
the parents cannot seem to get good lighting.&nbsp;
Hence, they hold the object camera and make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:26.000
their son click pictures. They have finally&nbsp;
found a use for him that only he is good at.
&nbsp;

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.400
Every night, they would change the boy’s tape&nbsp;
and put it in the cupboard safely. At first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:35.040
they are delighted that because of the tapes, he&nbsp;
will remember every moment in his life. But what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:40.720
the parents fail to register is that a lifetime's&nbsp;
worth of tapes requires a lifetime to watch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:46.000
The cupboard soon starts to fill up with tapes&nbsp;
and memories that are of no use to him. Soon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:51.040
the camera boy grows old enough to go to school.&nbsp;
Even though he has no expression on his face,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:56.480
we can tell he is nervous. Everyone looks at him&nbsp;
differently for obvious reasons. The kids start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:01.760
to bully him, pushing him around, calling him&nbsp;
camera head, and telling him he should be dead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:06.000
But they forget that the boy’s memory is&nbsp;
photographic. When his mother sees the tape&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:11.200
at the end of the day, she fumes in anger. She&nbsp;
visits the principal’s office the very next day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:16.400
and shows him the video. With clear evidence, the&nbsp;
bullies have no way to defend themselves. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:22.080
are punished for their actions and starting that&nbsp;
day, they stop bothering the camera boy. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:27.200
they move on to bullying another kid, calling&nbsp;
him fat and telling him to kill himself. 
&nbsp;

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:32.720
The camera boy watches them in fear, unknowingly&nbsp;
recording them. The tape yet again makes it to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:38.080
principal’s office and the bullies are taught a&nbsp;
lesson. As time goes by and the camera boy learns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:43.440
to socialize, he makes a lot of friends. His&nbsp;
uniqueness attracts people towards him but with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:49.680
the attention also comes drawbacks. His friends,&nbsp;
even the closest ones, often treat him like he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:56.240
only a camera. Soon, like any normal teenager, the&nbsp;
camera boy falls in love with a beautiful girl.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.240 --> 00:04:02.320
They go on dinner dates, talk about different&nbsp;
things, and seem to get along well. Until one day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:07.440
when they are in bed and things start to get&nbsp;
steamy. The camera boy tries undressing her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:12.000
but she suddenly realizes that he is&nbsp;
filming everything. She pushes him away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:17.200
calling him a pervert for something he has no&nbsp;
control over. The boy offers to put a lens cap on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:22.000
but the girl asks him to get out of her room.&nbsp;
She never talks to him again, leaving him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.560
heartbroken. He starts to think that he will&nbsp;
never find true love because of his face. 
&nbsp;

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:32.240
Starting that day, his life goes downhill. He&nbsp;
is never let inside a movie hall because of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:38.320
no-camera policy. Moreover, his father throws the&nbsp;
house TV away because the boy watching it would be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:44.560
considered piracy. He gets depressed and refuses&nbsp;
to go outside but even at home, he has nothing to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:51.120
do. He starts to get bored and lonely, cursing&nbsp;
his fate for making him unique. That is, until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:57.360
one day when his life changes. While walking down&nbsp;
a road, he comes across a girl. Weirdly enough,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:02.640
her face is unfocused from his point of view. He&nbsp;
tries moving his lenses in different positions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:07.760
but cannot seem to see her features. He doesn’t&nbsp;
know the reason for the weird phenomenon but it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:12.640
doesn’t bother him. The girl becomes his&nbsp;
friend and with time, they fall in love.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:17.760
Since he cannot see her face, she doesn’t mind&nbsp;
getting naked in front of him. It is almost as if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:23.600
God sensed he was depressed and sent her just for&nbsp;
him. The two have been dating for quite some time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:29.200
when one day, a man approaches them. He turns out&nbsp;
to be a producer who wants to make a show out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:34.400
the camera boy’s life. He wants the boy to hand&nbsp;
in all of the tapes that he has filmed till now so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:39.680
they can create a several episode show with less&nbsp;
budget. Handing in all the tapes means that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:45.120
should give up the tapes of them making love. 
The couple is reluctant at first but they agree&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:49.520
to be a part of it when given a briefcase&nbsp;
full of money. The show hits the television&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:54.880
and instantly becomes a success. The couple&nbsp;
gains millions of fans in only a few days.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.880 --> 00:06:00.160
They turn into celebrities and are swarmed by&nbsp;
paparazzi everywhere they go. With the money,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:06.000
they buy a brand new house together. As the show’s&nbsp;
popularity increases, the camera boy is given his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:10.720
own channel where people would have to pay&nbsp;
to see his life on live television. He soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:16.480
asks his girlfriend to be his wife. That part of&nbsp;
their life is also broadcasted live to the world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:22.480
They have no privacy at all but it is the least of&nbsp;
their concern because the show’s ratings skyrocket&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:28.080
after he proposes to her. They get married&nbsp;
as the world watches, happy for the couple.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:33.680
Then, something that had never crossed the camera&nbsp;
boy’s mind happens. People become addicted to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:39.840
show, so much so that the entire nation stays&nbsp;
indoors watching his life twenty-four seven. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:44.800
is almost as if he is the only living person&nbsp;
and all others are living life through him. 
&nbsp;

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:50.000
When he and his wife get bored of such a lonely&nbsp;
life, they return to his childhood home. As soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:55.280
as he opens the door, the piles of tapes of his&nbsp;
life come into his view. The house barely has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.280 --> 00:07:00.000
any space for furniture because of the tapes.&nbsp;
The boy goes to the first closet of the tapes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.960
and stares at them, reminiscing about his&nbsp;
childhood and thinking of how far he has come.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:10.640
Then, he goes to the living room to see that his&nbsp;
wife is in front of the TV. She, like the others,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:15.200
has been addicted to watching the show.&nbsp;
He tries to switch the TV off but nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:20.800
happens. He calls the wife, trying to wake her&nbsp;
up but she stays staring at the television.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:26.480
The boy sheds a single tear and finally realizes&nbsp;
that the only way to wake up the entire country&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:31.920
is to stop the live streaming show. So, he brings&nbsp;
out the first tape of his life that was ever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:37.360
recorded. He plays the tape on TV while in the&nbsp;
bathtub. People who are watching the live stream&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:42.320
also get to witness his birth through the video.&nbsp;
Everyone holds their breaths as the boy puts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:48.720
the TV into the tub, electrocuting himself. He&nbsp;
dies while watching the video of his birth.
&nbsp;

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:54.240
The live show finally ends with his death and&nbsp;
people register how obsessed they had gotten. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:59.840
go out and enjoy their lives like they did before&nbsp;
the show. His wife is at a park, heartbroken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:05.920
by his death. Yet, she is happy that people,&nbsp;
including herself, have come back to their senses.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:12.160
The movie ends as she watches a man and his kids&nbsp;
playing in the park and taking a picture together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:17.200
The camera reminds her of her late husband. 
